  <ThingDef ParentName="Rukaya_BaseActiveMatterMeleeWeapon">
    <defName>Rukaya_DivingKnife</defName>
    <label>Rukaya diving knife</label>
    <!-- 中文翻译：卢卡娅潜水刀 -->
    <description>A compact service knife carried by boarding teams, divers, and other close-quarters specialists. In ordinary mode it is quicker but less lethal than a standard combat knife. Active matter mode stores 30 units and dumps them into brutally powerful close stabs meant to end the fight in a handful of committed strikes.</description>
    <!-- 中文翻译：一把供登舰队员、潜水员和其他近距离作战专长人员携带的紧凑制式短刀。普通模式下，它比标准战斗刀更快，但杀伤更弱。活性物质模式可储存 30 点能量，并将其灌注进极其凶狠的近距离突刺中，意在用寥寥几次果断攻击结束战斗。 -->
